Distance: 1500m Conditions: Mild downstream current with minimal to no wind. Floating starts. Slight turn to port at approximately 750m. Comments: Boys 2nd boat &#45; GCDS &amp; ND had slight high five about 15 seconds into the race, no hands were raised &amp; points were already being adjusted, so race went on. Girls 1st boat &#45; GCDS coxswain cut the turn buoy just barely on the far side of it, so a 5 second penalty was incurred (original time was 5:25.22).
